OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fchance of some light rain across
OL,7,FDerbyshire. Staying dry with clear
OL,8,Fspells elsewhere. Breezy in the north
OL,9,Fbut lighter winds in the south,
OL,10,Fallowing a chance of some fog patches
OL,11,Flater in the night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FMostly cloudy in the far
OL,14,Fnorthwest with chance of rain at
OL,15,Ftimes. Dry and warm with brighter
OL,16,Fspells in remaining areas, once any
OL,17,Fmorning fog clears.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
