OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FOvernight fog clearing Tuesday
OL,7,Fmorning, then rain later. Rain,
OL,8,Foccasionally heavy, on Wednesday
OL,9,Fslowly clearing to some brightness.
OL,10,FCooler Thursday and mostly dry with
OL,11,Fsunny spells, but showers near coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
